                                "sense_id": "cb00caf2-61db-3802-90a5-3bc168fc7abc",
                                "text": "Kinderen vinden het leuk om de klimmuur in het park te gebruiken.",
                                "translation": "Children enjoy using the climbing wall in the park.",
                                "english": "Children enjoy using the climbing wall in the park."
                            },
                            {
