                                "sense_id": "cb00caf2-61db-3802-90a5-3bc168fc7abc",
                                "text": "Het klimmuurtje in hun tuin houdt de kinderen bezig.",
                                "translation": "The small climbing wall in their garden keeps the kids occupied.",
